WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:04.067
♪♪

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.601
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:09.067
The White House announced on
Friday that President Biden had

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:11.901
a cancerous skin lesion removed
from his chest.

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:14.901
And the lesion is already
running two points ahead

00:00:14.901 --> 00:00:16.200
of DeSantis.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:21.834
Former President Trump
attended CPAC over the weekend

00:00:21.834 --> 00:00:25.968
and told reporters he would not
drop out of the 2024 election

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:27.734
if he's indicted on criminal
charges.

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:30.868
You know, we compare him
to a mobster all the time,

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:33.834
but now he's literally saying,
"No problem,

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:36.167
I can still run things
from the joint."

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:38.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:40.534
In his speech over
the weekend at CPAC,

00:00:40.534 --> 00:00:43.033
former President Trump
said that before he came along,

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:45.834
the Republican Party was run
by freaks and fools.

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:51.267
Yeah. Nothing like the
Rhodes scholars we have today.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:53.434
That's like going to Orlando
and saying, "You know,

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:55.534
it wasn't always this nice."

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:58.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:01.367
Donald Trump Jr.'s
fiancee Kimberly Guilfoyle spoke

00:01:01.367 --> 00:01:04.567
over the weekend at CPAC, and
it looked like a rousing speech

00:01:04.567 --> 00:01:06.667
until they cut to the audience.
Take a look.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:10.767
-All of us in this room have
one message to Joe Biden --

00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:14.901
it is time to put America first!

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:17.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:19.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:22.400
-Which brings us to a segment
called "Where is Everybody?!"

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:25.467
♪♪

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:28.167
Where is everybody?
I've never seen a theater

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:32.067
that empty, and I used to do
long-form improv.

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:33.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:35.601
I've been in elevators more
crowded than that.

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:37.200
Where is there --

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.667
Did they accidentally schedule
you against Kid Rock karaoke?

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:44.334
That speech must have taken
twice as long

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:47.667
just to account for the echo.

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:49.067
Speaking of,
why are you yelling?

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:51.267
It's not like you need to play
to the back of the house.

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:54.033
And what's this,
"All of us in the room

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:55.868
have one message for Joe Biden"?

00:01:55.868 --> 00:01:58.701
You're the only one there.

00:01:58.701 --> 00:02:01.067
There couldn't be a second
message in the room

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:02.634
for Joe Biden.

00:02:02.634 --> 00:02:04.534
If anything, that room
has one message for you --

00:02:04.534 --> 00:02:06.033
bring it way down.

00:02:06.033 --> 00:02:07.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:10.534
-This has been...

00:02:10.534 --> 00:02:12.067
-It's a hit.
It's a hit new segment.

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:14.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:16.434
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
spoke yesterday

00:02:16.434 --> 00:02:18.234
at the Ronald Reagan
Presidential Library.

00:02:18.234 --> 00:02:21.234
Specifically, he said,
"All these gotta go."

00:02:21.234 --> 00:02:24.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.567
TV host Rachael Ray has
announced she's ending

00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:30.400
her talk show after 17 seasons.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.734
She made the decision in less
than 30 minutes,

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:34.634
but at home,
it would take you two hours.

00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:37.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.834 --> 00:02:40.067
Didn't do great.

00:02:40.067 --> 00:02:41.934
Better than I thought
it would do.

00:02:41.934 --> 00:02:45.901
So that's kind --
I'm not saying it's a win-win.

00:02:45.901 --> 00:02:49.300
It was definitely a win-lose,
but...

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.467
A woman in Florida recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:54.133
by winning 23 ultramarathons
in 23 days.

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:57.567
In less happy news, her car
is basically undrivable now.

00:02:57.567 --> 00:03:00.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.434 --> 00:03:03.133
Finally, United Airlines has
announced it will offer

00:03:03.133 --> 00:03:05.734
T-Mobile customers free Wi-Fi
on all flights,

00:03:05.734 --> 00:03:08.868
and Spirit announced that
they're gonna fly really close,

00:03:08.868 --> 00:03:10.901
and you should be able to hop on
their network.

00:03:10.901 --> 00:03:12.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.167 --> 00:03:13.601
[ Laughs ]

00:03:13.601 --> 00:03:16.067
Good Photoshop.
Good Photoshop.

00:03:16.901 --> 00:03:19.467
President Biden published
an op-ed today

00:03:19.467 --> 00:03:22.601
in The New York Times
and that man is spiraling.

00:03:22.601 --> 00:03:24.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.968 --> 00:03:27.501
Fox News host Tucker Carlson
last night claimed

00:03:27.501 --> 00:03:30.067
that the security camera footage
from the Capitol attack

00:03:30.067 --> 00:03:34.100
"does not show an insurrection
or a riot in progress."

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.501
Yeah, okay,
but when you cherry-pick

00:03:36.501 --> 00:03:38.968
the footage you're showing,
you can prove whatever you want.

00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:40.834
I could show you footage
from "John Wick"

00:03:40.834 --> 00:03:42.968
that proves he's not violent.
Take a look.

00:03:42.968 --> 00:03:44.801
-[ Whining ]

00:03:44.801 --> 00:03:45.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.901 --> 00:03:47.434
-We'll grab you
some kibble later.

00:03:47.434 --> 00:03:51.067
[ Tender tune plays ]
[ Collar rings against bowl ]

00:03:51.067 --> 00:03:53.801
-You're telling me that guy

00:03:53.801 --> 00:03:55.067
[ Laughter ]
is a trained killer?

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:56.434
Give me a break!

00:03:56.434 --> 00:03:57.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.534 --> 00:03:59.234
The footage doesn't lie.

00:03:59.234 --> 00:04:01.067
After Fox News
host Tucker Carlson

00:04:01.067 --> 00:04:04.067
aired exclusive security footage
from the Capitol attack,

00:04:04.067 --> 00:04:06.267
former President Trump posted
on Truth Social,

00:04:06.267 --> 00:04:09.100
"LET THE JANUARY 6
PRISONERS GO."

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:12.367
You guys know we can see
what you're doing, right?

00:04:12.367 --> 00:04:14.767
Kevin McCarthy,
who is Trump's Waylon Smithers,

00:04:14.767 --> 00:04:16.734
[ Laughter ]
gives all the footage
to Tucker;

00:04:16.734 --> 00:04:18.734
Tucker shows
only the tame parts;

00:04:18.734 --> 00:04:20.701
and then Trump claims
the rioters were framed.

00:04:20.701 --> 00:04:22.267
It's like watching a magic show

00:04:22.267 --> 00:04:24.968
where the magician
is wearing sheer sleeves.

00:04:24.968 --> 00:04:27.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:30.267
They do have very nice sheer
sleeves on the magician.

00:04:30.267 --> 00:04:32.067
[ Laughter ]
Didn't know how
it was going to look.

00:04:32.067 --> 00:04:33.634
I find out with you guys.
It's the best way

00:04:33.634 --> 00:04:35.734
to do quality control.

00:04:35.734 --> 00:04:36.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:38.534
In a new episode of her podcast,

00:04:38.534 --> 00:04:40.567
former First Lady
Michelle Obama said

00:04:40.567 --> 00:04:42.934
that she sobbed uncontrollably
for 30 minutes

00:04:42.934 --> 00:04:44.067
after leaving the White House

00:04:44.067 --> 00:04:45.534
at the end
of President Obama's term.

00:04:45.534 --> 00:04:47.334
As opposed to her husband,
who dealt

00:04:47.334 --> 00:04:50.334
with his post-presidency grief
more stoically.

00:04:50.334 --> 00:04:53.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:53.434 --> 00:04:56.367
Columbia University last week
announced it will no longer

00:04:56.367 --> 00:04:59.767
require SAT or ACT scores
in undergraduate admissions,

00:04:59.767 --> 00:05:01.901
while UMass announced
that you no longer need

00:05:01.901 --> 00:05:03.334
that show-and-tell project.

00:05:03.334 --> 00:05:06.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:07.901 --> 00:05:10.701
Massachusetts' own
Mike Scollins.

00:05:10.701 --> 00:05:12.834
[ Laughter ]
In a new interview,

00:05:12.834 --> 00:05:15.067
Transportation Secretary
Pete Buttigieg

00:05:15.067 --> 00:05:17.400
pushed back against critics
characterizing him

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.934
as being elitist
and out of touch

00:05:18.934 --> 00:05:21.400
and said his critics,
"wouldn't know their way

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.200
around a T.J.Maxx
if their life depended on it."

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:27.601
[ Laughter ]
But if you're lost
inside a T.J.Maxx,

00:05:27.601 --> 00:05:29.701
your life does depend on it.

00:05:29.701 --> 00:05:32.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.067 --> 00:05:33.434
That's right,
Pete Buttigieg said,

00:05:33.434 --> 00:05:35.534
"You think Tucker Carlson
knows the difference

00:05:35.534 --> 00:05:37.234
between a T.J.Maxx
and a Kohl's?"

00:05:37.234 --> 00:05:39.801
Actually, he might,
because aren't those his sons?

00:05:39.801 --> 00:05:41.033
[ As Carlson ]
T.J.Maxx, Kohl!

00:05:41.033 --> 00:05:43.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:43.067 --> 00:05:45.000
It's time for lacrosse practice.
Let's go!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.334
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.334 --> 00:05:49.100
Grocery delivery service
Hello Fresh confirmed yesterday

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.367
it will stop selling
coconut milk from Thailand

00:05:51.367 --> 00:05:53.868
over concerns
of forced monkey labor.

00:05:53.868 --> 00:05:56.968
From now on, they're only going
to use union monkeys.

00:05:56.968 --> 00:06:00.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:02.200
A group of entrepreneurs
in Massachusetts

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:05.567
have filed paperwork to open
a topless marijuana dispensary,

00:06:05.567 --> 00:06:07.801
[ Oohs ]
though they might run
into some legal issues,

00:06:07.801 --> 00:06:08.968
since they're ten.

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:11.901
[ Laughter, ohhs, and applause ]

00:06:16.901 --> 00:06:19.400
"Hi, we'd like to file
some papers.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.434
[ Laughter ]

00:06:21.434 --> 00:06:22.901
Yeah, we have an idea
for a business.

00:06:22.901 --> 00:06:25.901
[ Laughter ]

00:06:25.901 --> 00:06:28.667
Uh, can we -- can we put here,
'Don't tell our parents'?"

00:06:28.667 --> 00:06:30.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:30.734 --> 00:06:32.534
And finally, in honor
of St. Patrick's Day,

00:06:32.534 --> 00:06:35.467
Dairy Queen is offering its new
Under the Rainbow Shake,

00:06:35.467 --> 00:06:37.167
which features
vanilla soft serve

00:06:37.167 --> 00:06:38.367
and multicolored sprinkles.

00:06:38.367 --> 00:06:40.801
And Arby's is honoring
St. Paddy's Day

00:06:40.801 --> 00:06:42.934
by driving all the snakes
out of the kitchen.

00:06:43.834 --> 00:06:45.667
The White House said yesterday

00:06:45.667 --> 00:06:47.834
that it supports
a new bipartisan bill

00:06:47.834 --> 00:06:50.667
that would give President Biden
the power to ban TikTok.

00:06:50.667 --> 00:06:53.701
Of course, Biden could end
TikTok at any time

00:06:53.701 --> 00:06:55.567
simply by making an account.

00:06:55.567 --> 00:06:57.501
Ugh, okay.

00:06:57.501 --> 00:06:59.501
This jumped the shark.

00:06:59.501 --> 00:07:00.601
[ Laughter ]

00:07:00.601 --> 00:07:02.501
Capitol Police Chief
Thomas Manger

00:07:02.501 --> 00:07:03.868
issued a statement yesterday

00:07:03.868 --> 00:07:06.834
criticizing Fox host
Tucker Carlson's release

00:07:06.834 --> 00:07:09.501
of security footage
from the January 6th attack

00:07:09.501 --> 00:07:12.767
and said Carlson made "offensive
and misleading conclusions."

00:07:12.767 --> 00:07:14.767
Of course,
that's just what it says

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:17.267
when you turn on
his closed captioning.

00:07:17.267 --> 00:07:19.834
[ Laughter ]

00:07:19.834 --> 00:07:22.267
According to newly released
legal documents,

00:07:22.267 --> 00:07:24.434
Fox News host Tucker Carlson
told colleagues

00:07:24.434 --> 00:07:27.501
after the 2020 election,
"We are very, very close

00:07:27.501 --> 00:07:29.501
to being able to ignore Trump
most nights.

00:07:29.501 --> 00:07:32.834
I truly can't wait.
I hate him passionately."

00:07:32.834 --> 00:07:34.501
Wait, wait, are you telling me

00:07:34.501 --> 00:07:37.000
Tucker Carlson
is secretly sane?

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:42.300
I would feel so betrayed
if I was a Fox viewer.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:44.133
This is like
if you joined a cult,

00:07:44.133 --> 00:07:46.100
sold all your belongings,
shaved your head,

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:47.834
moved to the desert,
and then it turns out

00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:49.167
the cult leader is just, like...

00:07:49.167 --> 00:07:50.667
a Methodist.

00:07:50.667 --> 00:07:53.100
[ Laughter ]

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:55.834
Voters in Oklahoma
rejected a measure yesterday

00:07:55.834 --> 00:07:58.167
to legalize the recreational use
of marijuana.

00:07:58.167 --> 00:08:02.400
Apparently, time already moves
slowly enough in Oklahoma.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.067
[ Laughter ]

00:08:04.067 --> 00:08:06.000
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.334
reportedly sent a letter
to President Biden

00:08:08.334 --> 00:08:11.501
requesting that he allow
tennis star Novak Djokovic

00:08:11.501 --> 00:08:13.834
to enter the country to play
in the Miami Open tournament.

00:08:13.834 --> 00:08:14.901
That story again --

00:08:14.901 --> 00:08:16.901
Ron DeSantis begs Biden

00:08:16.901 --> 00:08:18.734
to open the border.

00:08:18.734 --> 00:08:20.534
[ Laughter ]

00:08:20.534 --> 00:08:23.200
After Senator Bernie Sanders
threatened to subpoena him,

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.901
Starbucks CEO Howard Schultz
has agreed to testify

00:08:25.901 --> 00:08:28.234
before the Senate's
Health, Education, Labor

00:08:28.234 --> 00:08:29.434
and Pensions Committee.

00:08:29.434 --> 00:08:31.834
And much like a black coffee
from Starbucks,

00:08:31.834 --> 00:08:33.167
this has been brewing

00:08:33.167 --> 00:08:34.834
for a very long time.

00:08:34.834 --> 00:08:36.467
[ Laughter ]

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.534
[ Laughter continues ]

00:08:40.534 --> 00:08:42.200
We talk -- you know,
I'll be honest with you --

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.634
behind the scenes,
we talked a little bit.

00:08:43.634 --> 00:08:44.968
Like, "Is that joke
gonna work at all?"

00:08:44.968 --> 00:08:46.300
And it worked a little.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.968
[ Laughter ]

00:08:47.968 --> 00:08:49.968
A venti?
How do you say a little?

00:08:51.801 --> 00:08:53.300
-Tall.
-Tall.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.133
[ Laughter ]

00:08:56.133 --> 00:08:58.467
That coffee joke
worked a tall.

00:08:58.467 --> 00:09:00.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:00.868 --> 00:09:03.367
My callback didn't work a-tall.

00:09:03.367 --> 00:09:04.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:04.868 --> 00:09:06.000
You know what?
We're getting there.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:07.267
We're getting -- We're almost --

00:09:07.267 --> 00:09:09.767
We've almost put
a button on this.

00:09:09.767 --> 00:09:12.100
Feel like I should have
gotten out a minute ago.

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:14.334
[ Laughter ]

00:09:14.334 --> 00:09:15.667
That's right, St--
Oh, boy.

00:09:15.667 --> 00:09:17.501
Now there's a follow-up
Starbucks joke.

00:09:17.501 --> 00:09:20.334
[ Laughter ]

00:09:20.334 --> 00:09:24.834
Way to keep the flow going,
Meyers.

00:09:24.834 --> 00:09:27.167
That's right,
Starbucks CEO Howard Schultz

00:09:27.167 --> 00:09:28.801
will testify
before a Senate committee

00:09:28.801 --> 00:09:31.801
as part of an investigation into
the chain's labor practices.

00:09:31.801 --> 00:09:34.234
And while he's there,
they've also got some questions

00:09:34.234 --> 00:09:36.067
about those egg bites.

00:09:36.067 --> 00:09:38.334
[ Laughter ]

00:09:42.501 --> 00:09:44.734
And finally,
Tinder recently released

00:09:44.734 --> 00:09:47.167
an Australian edition
of its dating dictionary,

00:09:47.167 --> 00:09:49.300
which includes the phrase
"kitten fishing."

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:51.901
That means
"changing aspects of yourself

00:09:51.901 --> 00:09:54.067
to appear more attractive
to others."

00:09:54.067 --> 00:09:55.634
Or, as we call that here,

00:09:55.634 --> 00:09:57.067
dating.

00:09:57.067 --> 00:09:58.734
[ Laughter ]

00:09:58.734 --> 00:10:01.701
President Biden unveiled his new
budget today, which proposes

00:10:01.701 --> 00:10:06.834
a 25% minimum tax on households
worth more than $100 million.

00:10:06.834 --> 00:10:09.901
Finally, some good news for
people whose households

00:10:09.901 --> 00:10:12.167
are worth $99 million.

00:10:12.167 --> 00:10:15.334
[ Laughter ]

00:10:15.334 --> 00:10:16.701
The White House
yesterday criticized

00:10:16.701 --> 00:10:18.167
Fox News host Tucker Carlson

00:10:18.167 --> 00:10:20.734
for his misleading portrayal
of the Capitol attack and said,

00:10:20.734 --> 00:10:22.767
"Tucker Carlson is not
credible."

00:10:22.767 --> 00:10:24.934
And I think they're right
because Tucker then said,

00:10:24.934 --> 00:10:27.501
"Thank you, Mr. President,
I respect your opinion."

00:10:27.501 --> 00:10:29.701
[ Laughter ]

00:10:29.701 --> 00:10:32.567
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis'
new book debuted this week

00:10:32.567 --> 00:10:34.033
at the number-one spot on

00:10:34.033 --> 00:10:35.467
The New York Times
Best-sellers List.

00:10:35.467 --> 00:10:38.300
To be fair, everything else has
been banned.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:41.601
[ Laughter ]

00:10:41.601 --> 00:10:43.968
Now, I -- Now I see why.

00:10:43.968 --> 00:10:45.734
[ Laughter ]

00:10:45.734 --> 00:10:48.634
Former President Trump is set
next month to publish a new book

00:10:48.634 --> 00:10:51.434
of private letters sent to him
titled "Letters to Trump,"

00:10:51.434 --> 00:10:55.501
though really, it's mostly final
notices from utility companies.

00:10:55.501 --> 00:10:57.901
[ Laughter ]

00:10:57.901 --> 00:11:00.200
That's right, Trump is
publishing a new book titled

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.734
"Letters to Trump," and I have
to say some of them are

00:11:02.734 --> 00:11:04.467
pretty heartbreaking.

00:11:04.467 --> 00:11:09.868
[ Laughter ]

00:11:09.868 --> 00:11:12.667
The CDC has launched an
investigation after more than

00:11:12.667 --> 00:11:16.534
300 people onboard the Princess
Cruises ship Ruby Princess

00:11:16.534 --> 00:11:18.200
fell ill during a recent voyage.

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:20.868
And then the investigation ended
at the word "cruises."

00:11:20.868 --> 00:11:22.000
Yep, there's your problem.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.000
[ Laughter ]

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.701
Federal authorities this week
charged a man with conspiracy to

00:11:26.701 --> 00:11:28.901
commit wire fraud after he
allegedly sold

00:11:28.901 --> 00:11:30.400
fake sports trading cards.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:33.801
Said a buyer, "You mean this
isn't a real Michael Jording?"

00:11:33.801 --> 00:11:36.734
[ Laughter ]

00:11:39.334 --> 00:11:41.400
The Las Vegas mansion
that belonged

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.167
to the late illusionists
Siegfried and Roy

00:11:43.167 --> 00:11:46.033
recently went up for sale
for $3 million.

00:11:46.033 --> 00:11:48.734
It would have been $4 million,
but, you know, they had cats.

00:11:48.734 --> 00:11:51.667
[ Laughter ]

00:11:54.033 --> 00:11:57.200
A car recently crashed through
the window of a cafe in Houston

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.100
and narrowly missed hitting
two men who were

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.334
recording a podcast.

00:12:00.334 --> 00:12:02.033
Nobody was injured, but sadly,

00:12:02.033 --> 00:12:04.601
the men were able to finish
their podcast.

00:12:04.601 --> 00:12:07.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:11.167
It's available wherever you get
your podcasts.

00:12:11.167 --> 00:12:13.100
[ Laughter ]

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:15.267
And finally, the makers
of Hidden Valley Ranch

00:12:15.267 --> 00:12:16.834
announced today
that they've collaborated

00:12:16.834 --> 00:12:18.901
[ Oohs ]
with ice cream company --

00:12:18.901 --> 00:12:21.834
[ Laughter ]
[ Tapping ]

00:12:25.567 --> 00:12:28.767
I don't think the setup's ever
bummed people out that much.

00:12:28.767 --> 00:12:30.801
[ Laughter ]

00:12:30.801 --> 00:12:32.601
And finally, the makers
of Hidden Valley Ranch

00:12:32.601 --> 00:12:34.267
announced today
that they've collaborated

00:12:34.267 --> 00:12:36.000
with ice cream company
Van Leeuwen

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.067
to offer a Hidden Valley Ranch
ice cream.

00:12:38.067 --> 00:12:40.434
It's what people in the Midwest
are calling a salad.

00:12:40.434 --> 00:12:41.367
You guys!

00:12:41.367 --> 00:12:42.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:42.901 --> 00:12:44.901
That was the monologue.
We're off and running.

00:12:44.901 --> 00:12:48.434
♪♪

00:12:48.434 --> 00:12:50.467
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

